 "summary": "An N-channel enhancement-mode MOSFET in the three-lead SOT-23, rated 60 V drain to source and 3 A continuous drain current (10 A pulsed). On-resistance is 78 mΩ typical and 105 mΩ maximum with 10 V on the gate, 125 mΩ maximum with 4.5 V; the gate threshold lies between 1 V and 2 V. Gate-source voltage is limited to ±20 V. It is offered as a small-signal switch.",
